<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Profile • Sambhav Security Lab</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="badge">🧑‍💻 Profile Explorer</div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
                <a href="/blackbox">Black Box</a>
                <a href="/crypto-leak">Crypto Leak</a>
                <a href="/audit-log">Audit Log</a>
                <a href="/debug">Debug</a>
                <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <header class="hero-card" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
            <h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size:2.2rem;">User Profile</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Demonstrating insecure direct object references.</p>
            <% if (flag) { %>
                <div class="hero-tag" style="margin-top:18px;">🚩 IDOR Flag: <strong><%= flag %></strong></div>
            <% } %>
        </header>

        <section class="card" style="padding:32px;">
            <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">Identity Card</h2>
            <p><strong>Username:</strong> <%= profileUser.username %></p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <%= profileUser.email %></p>
            <p><strong>Role:</strong> <%= profileUser.role %></p>
            <p><strong>Created:</strong> <%= profileUser.created_at %></p>
        </section>

        <section class="alert" style="margin-top:32px;">
            <h3>🔓 Training Tip</h3>
            <p>Notice there are no checks to ensure the authenticated user is allowed to view this profile. Manipulate the URL ID
                to enumerate other accounts.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
